      "writtenOn": "2025-02-06T16:06:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would name this just `equal`. The `referenceEqualsSuppressed` sound like \"supressed equals relation\" to me :-) I am sure not a native speaker but I don\u0027t think that the necessity to suppress some erorprone errors shall reflect in the method name(s).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 81,
        "startChar": 14,
        "endLine": 81,
        "endChar": 39
      },
      "revId": "a90948ae2cefbacd9841965e6bbf9f2a9ab22bea",
