      "writtenOn": "2025-02-07T10:12:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This also works and preserves the code structure as we want it to be:\n```\n  @SuppressWarnings(\"ReferenceEquality\")\n  public void put(K key) {\n    BloomFilter\u003cK\u003e b;\n    do {\n      b \u003d bloomFilter;\n      if (b !\u003d null) {\n        b.put(key);\n      }\n    } while (b !\u003d bloomFilter);\n  }\n```",
